## Consolidation

- [ ] Consolidate XDG autostart entries into one place
  - Currently split: per-user via `xdg.configFile."autostart/..."` in home-manager
    (syncthing-gtk, discord in `home.nix`; flameshot in `flameshot-screenshots.nix`)
    and system-wide via `environment.etc."xdg/autostart/..."` in NixOS
    (timekpr-client in `timekpr.nix`)
  - Pick one canonical approach (probably home-manager for user apps, NixOS for
    system services) and document the convention

